{12015}{Oh, please! I will not follow one of such a disgustingly sweet disposition!}{Oh, please! I will not follow one of such a disgustingly sweet disposition!}{}{1}{}{}
{12016}{The darkness of your heart troubles me. No, I do not believe I could follow you, in all good conscience.}{The darkness of your heart troubles me. No, I do not believe I could follow you, in all good conscience.}{}{2}{}{}
{12017}{Of course I won't follow you. I hate you. How preposterous! Me following you!}{Of course I won't follow you. I hate you. How preposterous! Me following you!}{}{3}{}{}
{12018}{Without my help, your chances of victory diminish greatly if they do not vanish altogether. I hope that you will reconsider this hasty course of action.}{Without my help, your chances of victory diminish greatly if they do not vanish altogether. I hope that you will reconsider this hasty course of action.}{}{4}{}{}
{12019}{You fool! Without my assistance you will surely die!}{You fool! Without my assistance you will surely die!}{}{5}{}{}
{12020}{Most assuredly.}{Most assuredly.}{}{6}{}{}
{12021}{I do not believe I will be doing that.}{I do not believe I will be doing that.}{}{7}{}{}
{12022}{Mind where your blows are falling.}{Mind where your blows are falling.}{}{8}{}{}
{12023}{Splendid! I applaud your talent at smiting fools!}{Splendid! I applaud your talent at smiting fools!}{}{9}{}{}
{12024}{Your combat "expertise" borders on the ridiculous.}{Your combat "expertise" borders on the ridiculous.}{}{10}{}{}
{12026}{I will not join with you until you lessen the number of your followers.}{I will not join with you until you lessen the number of your followers.}{}{11}{}{}
{12027}{I find your company distasteful. Of course I won't follow you.}{I find your company distasteful. Of course I won't follow you.}{}{12}{}{}
{12028}{Your level of experience is laughable, as is your expectation that I would follow you.}{Your level of experience is laughable, as is your expectation that I would follow you.}{}{13}{}{}
{12029}{Perhaps...yes, I believe it is time to take my leave of this situation.}{Perhaps...yes, I believe it is time to take my leave of this situation.}{}{14}{}{}
{12046}{Oh, please. I will take care of this.}{Oh, please. I will take care of this.}{}{15}{}{}
{12047}{I don't think it is a wise practice to attack our allies.}{I don't think it is a wise practice to attack our allies.}{}{16}{}{}
{12048}{How could you have us attack something so pure?! What are you thinking?}{How could you have us attack something so pure?! What are you thinking?}{}{17}{}{}
{12051}{Your path of righteousness is a bit too...clean for one such as myself.}{Your path of righteousness is a bit too...clean for one such as myself.}{}{18}{}{}
{12052}{Your evilness is beginning to offend even me!}{Your evilness is beginning to offend even me!}{}{19}{}{}
{12053}{My dislike of you is growing at an alarming rate.}{My dislike of you is growing at an alarming rate.}{}{20}{}{}
{12054}{Heh, it seems we've...underestimated our opponents...I am dying...}{Heh, it seems we've...underestimated our opponents...I am dying...}{}{21}{}{}

